Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.19,0:00:06.00,Film,,0,0,0,,Hi! And welcome to SCRPT\NStudios!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.93,Film,,0,0,0,,You're about to see our\Nfull production line —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:11.55,Film,,0,0,0,,from one idea to every\Nproduct we create.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.74,Film,,0,0,0,,Let's start here, in the\Nwriting department.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.73,Film,,0,0,0,,This is where we hatch\Nideas for new stories and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:19.35,Film,,0,0,0,,turn them into full books.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:20.53,Film,,0,0,0,,Chapter by chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:22.25,Film,,0,0,0,,This is the art\Ndepartment,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:24.79,Film,,0,0,0,,where every book gets its\Nface — covers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.79,0:00:26.82,Film,,0,0,0,,artwork and the character\Nbible,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.82,0:00:30.06,Film,,0,0,0,,so every person in your\Nstory looks the same on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:30.96,Film,,0,0,0,,page,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:32.16,Film,,0,0,0,,on the cover, and on\Nscreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:34.08,Film,,0,0,0,,Our audiobook studios —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:37.34,Film,,0,0,0,,where the books learn to\Nspeak. Listen—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:42.90,Film,,0,0,0,,The mountain had taken\Nthirty-one bodies in Luc
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:44.95,Film,,0,0,0,,Reyer's lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.95,0:00:49.53,Film,,0,0,0,,He had carried down every\None of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:52.58,Film,,0,0,0,,And this is the part I\Nlove — the film studios.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:56.89,Film,,0,0,0,,The stories become films\Nhere, right on this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:59.62,Film,,0,0,0,,This is the editing wing —\Nevery scene is cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.11,Film,,0,0,0,,scored and mixed in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.11,0:01:03.31,Film,,0,0,0,,It's also where we make\Nthe trailers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:05.21,Film,,0,0,0,,and all the marketing\Ncreatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:07.43,Film,,0,0,0,,And this is our\Ndistribution centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:10.32,Film,,0,0,0,,From here we ship\Neverything to the platforms —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:12.54,Film,,0,0,0,,the books to Amazon and\NApple Books,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:14.88,Film,,0,0,0,,the audiobooks to Audible\Nand Spotify,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:17.53,Film,,0,0,0,,and our films to Amazon\NPrime and YouTube —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:20.55,Film,,0,0,0,,ready to meet the audience\Nas a finished product.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:23.08,Film,,0,0,0,,Everything you've just\Nseen is an imagined world —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:26.73,Film,,0,0,0,,but it shows you something\Nreal: what SCRPT can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.34,Film,,0,0,0,,for you as a creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:32.07,Film,,0,0,0,,The writers, the artists,\Nthe studios, the trucks —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:33.53,Film,,0,0,0,,that's our software,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:36.97,Film,,0,0,0,,doing every one of those\Njobs for your stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:40.26,Film,,0,0,0,,Books, audiobooks, films —\Nwritten, produced,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:41.94,Film,,0,0,0,,published and promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:45.52,Film,,0,0,0,,And the whole studio is\Nyours the moment you sign
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:45.74,Film,,0,0,0,,in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:49.17,Film,,0,0,0,,SCRPT — One Idea. Every\NFormat.
